<main>

  <div class="page-head wrap">
    <h1>Every person here is a student.</h1>
    <p class="lede">DOT is run by an executive board of ten, with programs delivered by student leaders at each participating school. Nobody is paid. Everyone is doing this around a full course load.</p>
  </div>

  <section class="wrap" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="lead-card">
      <div class="who">Teresa Pan</div>
      <div>
        <p class="role">Executive Director &amp; founder. Sets programming direction, runs partnerships and outreach to schools, and leads the Thursday sessions at West Point Grey Academy.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>The executive board</h2>
        <p>Ten students holding distinct portfolios, so that no part of the organization depends on one person.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="roster">
        <li><b>[Name]</b><span>Director of Internal Affairs — board coordination, meetings, and records</span></li>
        <li><b>[Name]</b><span>Director of STEM Programs — session design and curriculum</span></li>
        <li><b>[Name]</b><span>Director of Non-STEM Programs — tutoring and mentorship</span></li>
        <li><b>[Name]</b><span>Director of Logistics &amp; Inventory — materials, kits, and supply runs</span></li>
        <li><b>[Name]</b><span>Director of Finance — budgeting, fundraising, and grant reporting</span></li>
        <li><b>[Name]</b><span>Director of Marketing — social media and communications</span></li>
        <li><b>[Name]</b><span>Director of IT — website, systems, and digital resources</span></li>
        <li><b>[Name]</b><span>Director of Volunteer Engagement — recruiting and supporting volunteers</span></li>
        <li><b>[Name]</b><span>Director of Events — fundraisers and one-off workshops</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Session leaders</h2>
      <p>The grade 9 students who plan and run the weekly club at West Point Grey Academy.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="leaders">
      <li>Teresa</li>
      <li>Reyna</li>
      <li>Kian</li>
      <li>Isaac</li>
    </ul>
    <p style="margin-top:2rem" class="thanks">With thanks to Mrs. Anthony, our teacher sponsor at West Point Grey Academy, who gives up a lunch recess every week so the club can run.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Join the team</h2>
        <p>We take on student leaders at each school that hosts the program, and we are always short of people who want to design a session and stand up in front of a room of eight-year-olds.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="actions" style="margin-top:0">
        <a class="btn" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfsxILqWH2CKtHLRbc7FM54V7_Df_1RlEPNAdUiFZBTjQks7Q/viewform">Volunteer with us</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="mailto:dotinitiative25@gmail.com?subject=Joining%20the%20DOT%20team">Email us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

